I did my job just like you told me to.

267
00:21:38,620 --> 00:21:40,180
Give me back my heart.

268
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:43,580
Take you down, huh?

269
00:21:44,120 --> 00:21:46,260
Ain't a bad idea. Huh?

270
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:50,800
Not like I have any particular
fondness for you mugs.

271
00:22:01,160 --> 00:22:06,497
Thing is, we're in this together,
and I care about my men so much.

272
00:22:06,580 --> 00:22:09,857
I love my wife and child so much;

273
00:22:09,940 --> 00:22:15,757
there's no way in hell
I'm letting them die here!

274
00:22:15,840 --> 00:22:16,960
Honey!

275
00:22:18,160 --> 00:22:18,990
Father!

276
00:22:24,500 --> 00:22:25,330
Benji!

277
00:22:29,820 --> 00:22:32,440
If we want everyone in here to survive,

278
00:22:35,540 --> 00:22:37,280
there's only one answer.

279
00:22:37,640 --> 00:22:38,800
You have a plan?

280
00:22:39,840 --> 00:22:40,670
What is it?

281
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:48,900
if you don't get out there
then i'm gonna destroy you.

282
00:22:51,360 --> 00:22:53,497
it's only a matter of time now,

283
00:22:53,580 --> 00:22:57,109
get ready to bust them up the
second they come out of there.

284
00:22:57,920 --> 00:23:03,977
i can't escape now—show no
mercy, kill every last one!

285
00:23:04,060 --> 00:23:04,890
don't

286
00:23:07,560 --> 00:23:11,217
keep a lady waiting because i think
i'm due for some sweet revenge.

287
00:23:11,300 --> 00:23:12,130
okay,

288
00:23:15,840 --> 00:23:22,697
so here's how it goes: the big fodder
looks like a castle but it's still me.

289
00:23:22,780 --> 00:23:25,397
so this room is actually inside my body.

290
00:23:25,480 --> 00:23:26,310
hey,

291
00:23:27,920 --> 00:23:29,697
don't freak out on me kid!

292
00:23:29,780 --> 00:23:30,610
No

293
00:23:32,320 --> 00:23:34,177
matter how much I get roughed up outside.

294
00:23:34,260 --> 00:23:35,090
Even

295
00:23:37,020 --> 00:23:39,997
if the big fodder gets
knocked over flat on its back.

296
00:23:40,080 --> 00:23:40,910
The

297
00:23:41,380 --> 00:23:43,857
rest of you won't get hurt
or even shaken around.

298
00:23:43,940 --> 00:23:44,770
In

299
00:23:45,100 --> 00:23:49,197
other words, as long as I don't bite
the big one, you guys are safe in here.

300
00:23:49,280 --> 00:23:50,197
I hadn't noticed.

301
00:23:50,280 --> 00:23:53,177
Only Veggie has been
affected by the attack.

302
00:23:53,260 --> 00:23:54,090
You

303
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:58,277
can hear Big Mom pounding
her fists against the walls.

304
00:23:58,360 --> 00:23:59,190
But

305
00:24:00,720 --> 00:24:02,457
it's perfectly calm in here.

306
00:24:02,540 --> 00:24:03,370
You're

307
00:24:06,560 --> 00:24:07,917
starting to get it now.

308
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:12,637
And even if I change back into my human
form, the inside is still unaffected.

309
00:24:12,720 --> 00:24:18,557
Listen, I'll change back from my
castle form, keeping all I is inside.

310
00:24:18,640 --> 00:24:21,937
Then Caesar will carry me
and fly away to escape.

311
00:24:22,020 --> 00:24:22,850
If

312
00:24:23,120 --> 00:24:25,997
we can make it to the shore,
we'll blow this popsicle!

313
00:24:26,080 --> 00:24:26,910
popsicle

314
00:24:28,960 --> 00:24:29,790
Hey!

315
00:24:29,873 --> 00:24:32,937
Why do I have to risk my life out
there while everybody else stays safe?

316
00:24:33,020 --> 00:24:35,277
And this plan is a suicide
mission, by the way.

317
00:24:35,360 --> 00:24:38,457
We'll get riddled with bullets the
second those maniacs lay eyes on us.

318
00:24:38,540 --> 00:24:41,177
This plan has a less than
0 % chance of success.

319
00:24:41,260 --> 00:24:42,857
Even turning into gas won't help.

320
00:24:42,940 --> 00:24:45,997
They'll just use their stinking
armament Haki to take me out.

321
00:24:46,080 --> 00:24:47,480
Answer me one thing.

322
00:24:50,040 --> 00:24:50,870
Sanji.

323
00:24:53,760 --> 00:24:55,580
Why did you save us?

324
00:24:57,620 --> 00:25:02,220
We fell into that trap on our own,
and we are hardly your allies.

325
00:25:05,040 --> 00:25:08,560
Because my father would be
disappointed in me, that's why.

326
00:25:10,440 --> 00:25:14,340
I used to hold on to all the
resentment from so many years ago.

327
00:25:17,060 --> 00:25:19,260
Why did I do wrong, Dad?

328
00:25:19,720 --> 00:25:20,820
Let me out!

329
00:25:21,280 --> 00:25:22,500
I'm sorry!

330
00:25:22,980 --> 00:25:25,740
I'm sorry that I was supposed to leave!

331
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:28,200
Please, help me!

332
00:25:28,320 --> 00:25:30,600
I can't live in here by myself!

333
00:25:35,760 --> 00:25:39,057
If I'd grown up to be such
a small-minded man that

334
00:25:39,140 --> 00:25:41,757
I would laugh at the death
of my own flesh and blood,

335
00:25:41,840 --> 00:25:43,340
I couldn't face him.

336
00:25:45,460 --> 00:25:46,317
Take care.

337
00:25:46,400 --> 00:25:47,580
Don't catch cold.

338
00:25:48,620 --> 00:25:53,900
If I can't stand tall and look my
father in the eye, then I've failed him.

339
00:25:59,300 --> 00:26:03,077
No matter what, if anyone
ever asks about your family,

340
00:26:03,160 --> 00:26:06,660
you must never tell
them who your father is.

341
00:26:12,760 --> 00:26:15,917
Having you as a son is my greatest shame.

342
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:17,740
You must know that.

343
00:26:21,720 --> 00:26:23,160
Thirteen years ago,

344
00:26:23,560 --> 00:26:27,620
Vinsmoke Sanji escaped from the
Kingdom of Germa and died at sea.

345
00:26:28,540 --> 00:26:30,740
You got exactly what you wanted.

346
00:26:43,240 --> 00:26:45,260
After this, we're done!

347
00:26:46,000 --> 00:26:50,160
You're not my father, Finn Smoke
Judge, and don't you forget that.

348
00:26:51,300 --> 00:26:54,418
After this, I don't ever
want to see your face again!

349
00:27:19,180 --> 00:27:20,200
I understand.

350
00:27:21,420 --> 00:27:22,860
You have my word.

351
00:27:23,460 --> 00:27:25,520
This is the last you'll see of me.

352
00:27:25,680 --> 00:27:28,386
And I'll stay away from
the East Blue as well.

353
00:27:35,120 --> 00:27:37,560
Would you stop relying on me for help?

354
00:27:37,780 --> 00:27:39,920
I fulfilled my part of the bargain!

355
00:27:40,220 --> 00:27:43,760
If you don't help us, then
you die too! Jesus! Huh?

356
00:27:46,280 --> 00:27:47,840
Open the castle gate!

357
00:27:49,600 --> 00:27:51,460
Hear my words, Peggy.

358
00:27:51,640 --> 00:27:54,300
Until Caesar delivers
you safely from here,

359
00:27:54,780 --> 00:27:57,192
Germa double six will act as your guards.

360
00:27:57,660 --> 00:27:58,490
What? No!

361
00:27:58,700 --> 00:28:00,077
You don't get to volunteer me!

362
00:28:00,160 --> 00:28:01,217
I didn't agree to this!

363
00:28:01,300 --> 00:28:04,594
You're acting all noble, but
you're as arrogant as ever!

364
00:28:07,540 --> 00:28:08,520
I forgot.

365
00:28:08,880 --> 00:28:11,233
You Germa people can fly too, can't you?

366
00:28:11,520 --> 00:28:14,060
So we can leave without yous? Certainly.

367
00:28:16,800 --> 00:28:17,630
Good!

368
00:28:17,713 --> 00:28:20,112
If we're buying time, then I'll help too!

369
00:28:20,840 --> 00:28:23,260
It's alright, Luffy. You sure?

370
00:28:45,700 --> 00:28:49,320
I don't want to be indebted
to that failure any longer.

371
00:28:52,240 --> 00:28:54,540
This is his way of making amends.

372
00:28:56,260 --> 00:28:58,460
Hey, don't get ahead of yourselves.

373
00:28:58,740 --> 00:29:01,152
I still haven't agreed to this, you know.

374
00:29:01,840 --> 00:29:02,960
Stop whining.

375
00:29:03,780 --> 00:29:04,960
Just do it.

376
00:29:08,100 --> 00:29:09,380
Don't pay for me!

377
00:29:13,540 --> 00:29:18,140
You can't hide from me, Bimsy!

378
00:29:26,960 --> 00:29:30,040
Jennifer, don't hold anything back!
